## Starter Scaffold (files and routes to generate for a fresh project)

Create the following minimal, working files so the app boots without errors and renders a basic page:

```
/app/layout.tsx
/app/page.tsx
/app/(public)/browse/page.tsx (optional demo route)
/app/components/ui/Card.tsx (example shared primitive)
/app/globals.css
/postcss.config.js
/tailwind.config.ts
/tsconfig.json (strict as above)
/next.config.js (empty or minimal as needed)
/Docs/Implementation.md
/Docs/project_structure.md
/Docs/UI_UX_doc.md
```

Example `app/layout.tsx` (no classes, functional components only):
```
export default function RootLayout({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {
  return (
    <html lang="en">
      <body>{children}</body>
    </html>
  );
}
```

Example `app/page.tsx` landing placeholder using Tailwind v4 and `lucide-react`:
```
import { ArrowRight } from 'lucide-react';

export default function Page() {
  return (
    <main className="p-8">
      <h1 className="text-2xl font-semibold">It works</h1>
