Run commands in order:
1. `yarn`
2. Kill existing node processes (Windows example above)
3. `yarn dev`


## Theme Selection and Styling System (Styling-only; no tech-stack config)

This generator supports selectable themes to ensure polished, consistent UI across new projects without changing the tech stack. Themes are applied via CSS variables, Tailwind classes, and DRY UI primitives only.

### Parameters
- `theme`: one of `apple-glass`, `minimal-saas`, `banking-dark`
  - Default: `apple-glass`
  - Heuristics (enabled):
    - Fintech/banking → `banking-dark`
    - Consumer/premium → `apple-glass`
    - SaaS/operations → `minimal-saas`
  - Always allow explicit override via `theme: <name>` in the generation input.

### Theme Assets to Materialize (Styling-only files)
Place under `styles/` and import from `app/globals.css`. Do not modify non-styling configs here.

- `styles/tokens.css`: base CSS variables shared by all themes
```
:root {
  /* surfaces & text */
  --bg: 255 255 255; /* rgb triplets for Tailwind color utilities */
  --fg: 16 20 24;
  --muted: 113 113 122;
  /* brand */
  --primary: 0 106 255;
  --secondary: 12 94 215;
  --accent: 99 102 241;
  /* focus & rings */
  --ring: 59 130 246;
  /* radius & shadow tokens */
  --radius: 12px;
  --shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.15);
}
```

- `styles/themes/apple-glass.css`: Apple-inspired glassmorphism
```
[data-theme="apple-glass"] {
  --bg: 246 248 252;
  --fg: 15 23 42;
  --muted: 100 116 139;
  --primary: 0 122 255;
  --secondary: 88 86 214;
  --accent: 52 199 89;
  --ring: 0 122 255;
  --radius: 14px;
  --shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.18);
}

/* glass utility helpers (class names used by primitives) */
.glass-card {
  backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(16px);
  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
}

.glass-nav {
  backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(12px);
  background-color: rgba(246, 248, 252, 0.55);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
}
```

- `styles/themes/minimal-saas.css`: neutral, clean SaaS
```
[data-theme="minimal-saas"] {
  --bg: 250 250 250;
  --fg: 23 23 23;
  --muted: 115 115 115;
  --primary: 37 99 235;
  --secondary: 2 132 199;
  --accent: 14 165 233;
  --ring: 37 99 235;
  --radius: 10px;
  --shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.12);
}
```

- `styles/themes/banking-dark.css`: high-contrast fintech
```
[data-theme="banking-dark"] {
  --bg: 8 10 12;
  --fg: 226 232 240;
  --muted: 148 163 184;
  --primary: 80 184 60;
  --secondary: 45 212 191;
  --accent: 34 197 94;
  --ring: 34 197 94;
  --radius: 12px;
  --shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
}
```

### Wiring (Styling-only)
- `app/globals.css` should import tokens and the selected theme after Tailwind import:
```
@import 'tailwindcss';
@import '../styles/tokens.css';
@import '../styles/themes/apple-glass.css'; /* replaced by generator based on selection */
```

- `app/layout.tsx` should set the `data-theme` attribute on `<html>`:
```
export default function RootLayout({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {
  return (
    <html lang="en" data-theme="apple-glass">{/* replaced by generator */}
      <body>{children}</body>
    </html>
  );
}
```

### UI Primitive Styling Rules (DRY + composition)
- Use variable-driven utilities so themes cascade automatically:
  - Backgrounds: `bg-[rgb(var(--bg))]`
  - Text: `text-[rgb(var(--fg))]`
  - Muted text: `text-[rgb(var(--muted))]`
  - Brand: `text-[rgb(var(--primary))]`, `bg-[rgb(var(--primary))]`
  - Borders: `border-[color:rgb(var(--muted))]/20`
  - Radius: `rounded-[var(--radius)]`
  - Shadow: `shadow-[var(--shadow)]`
- Prefer `lucide-react` icons; avoid emojis.
- Keep primitives in `app/components/ui/` and prefer composition over variant explosion.

Example Button classes (reference only):
```
const base = 'inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-[var(--radius)] px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[rgb(var(--ring))]';
const primary = 'bg-[rgb(var(--primary))] text-white hover:opacity-90';
```

### Validation Additions (Styling)
- [ ] `app/page.tsx` renders at least one Card and Button using theme variables
- [ ] Focus ring visible with `focus-visible`
- [ ] If `apple-glass`, glass backdrop blur applied on a demo Card (`.glass-card`)

